        <description>&lt;p&gt;Every dialog gets a small question mark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The question mark**: dialogs stay clear and concise, and a small question-mark button expands the fuller story — what happened technically, what the remedy button will actually do, and where the log lives. First on the error console; every new dialog adopts it as law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The error report now carries its technical rendering behind the question mark instead of burying it or dumping it in your face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
